==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[mover]] [[and]] [[shaker]]|pl=movers and shakers}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} someone who has [[power]] and [[influence]] in some [[field]] or [[activity]].
#: ''The sales team sought to talk to the '''movers and shakers''' within an organization, rather than to their underlings.''
#: ''He really is a '''mover and a shaker''' in those circles.''
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} The people in an organization who are most responsible for getting things done.

